{"created_at": "2026-11-20", "mode": "direct_response", "note_id": "NOTE-20261120-d33fad", "path": "readings/2026-11-20-who-held-the-mug.md", "read_depth": "full_text_read", "report_session_id": "SESSION-20261120-8ef5d4", "session_id": "SESSION-20261120-8ef5d4", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 2, "claims": [{"claim_id": "C1", "kind": "reading_revised", "anchor": "§2–3", "material_ids": ["MAT-LIT-20261024-39db47"], "question_ids": ["Q-001"], "no_hypothesis": true, "text": "自伝の井戸から帰って人形の破片を拾う行為までを読む。後から意味が変わるのは水の名だけでなく自分のしたことでもある。"}, {"claim_id": "C2", "kind": "handoff", "anchor": "§4–5", "question_ids": ["Q-002"], "material_ids": ["MAT-LIT-20261024-39db47", "MAT-LIT-20261027-06cfe7"], "text": "三つの出典に同じ問いを返し、事実・汲み手の名指し・後代の推定を分ける。書簡を読めても自伝の名指しは増えない。"}]}
{"created_at": "2026-11-20", "date_real": "2026-11-20", "mode": "revision_and_variation", "note_id": "NOTE-20261120-6211a0", "path": "readings/2026-11-20-two-tier-gist-gate-and-the-opaque-auditor.md", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "read_depth": "full_text_read", "report_session_id": "SESSION-20261120-6211a0", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "session_id": "SESSION-20261120-6211a0", "claims": [{"claim_id": "CLM-20261120-6211a0-01", "kind": "reading_revised", "anchor": "§2.2", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-002", "Q-003"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261120-58ddce", "HYP-20261120-e6e225"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261120-bdee87", "MAT-20261120-9a4fdc", "MAT-20261119-6d6780"], "text": "実作業日シャードの前向き追跡（N=1,739およびN=4,998）により、notes.claims単体の翌日以降EVL到達率（1.16%/0.81%）はBELIEF_MAP仮説結合（12.50%/7.50%）の約1/10に落ち、純逐語再読の23/24（95.8%）・EVL救済5/5はシード乱数注入に依存するため、58ddceの単一要旨門・完全不可逆性とe6e225の等価痕跡前提を射程限定する。"}, {"claim_id": "CLM-20261120-6211a0-02", "kind": "reading_revised", "anchor": "§2.3", "question_ids": ["Q-002", "Q-003"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261119-0ddede", "HYP-20261117-d3ac84"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261120-bdee87", "MAT-20261119-37dee6"], "text": "2026-11-16..19の手読み素材-日ペア（N=964）で、仮説未束ね手読みは当日同一セッションEVL 55.84%に対し翌日別セッションEVL 0.49%へ崩壊し、in_reply_to付き31件の翌日EVLは0/31（0.0%）だったため、0ddedeを同一セッション内の局所読書ゲート（d3ac84）へ射程限定する。"}, {"claim_id": "CLM-20261120-6211a0-03", "kind": "measured_fact", "anchor": "§3.1–§3.2", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-002", "Q-003"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261119-8b3e04", "HYP-20261117-4bf2dc", "HYP-20261119-30d3f5"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261120-9a4fdc", "MAT-20261119-4d704a", "MAT-20261119-37dee6", "MAT-20261120-5f4051"], "text": "同一セッションdepth>=1評価34件では散文警戒語>=5回でも批判率0/4（最多60回のSESSION-20261120-888c18もsupports）に対し横断セッションは394/620（63.5%）であり、またread_logのcontested行による後続EVL批判率上昇は認められず（60.4%対63.6%、先行contested素材の後続EVL引用0/643）、8b3e04と4bf2dcを支持し30d3f5の頭蓋内単独校正を限定する。"}, {"claim_id": "CLM-20261120-6211a0-04", "kind": "handoff", "anchor": "§7.2", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-002"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261119-8b3e04", "HYP-20261119-63b6bf", "HYP-20261119-0ddede"], "text": "上位3件のself_only_provisional状態（30d3f5・58ddce・e6e225）は解消された。次回のconsolidatorは、P_gate首位に収斂した8b3e04と、履歴基底Pで過去の遡及相続質量を残す63b6bf・0ddedeとの基底間乖離の系譜整理を検討されたい。"}]}
